  "description": "Complete SQLite table registration toolkit for .NET MAUI apps.\n\nFeatures:\n- Source generator that creates table initialization code from [RegisterTable] attributes\n- Analyzer that warns when Table<T> is used with unregistered types  \n- Code fix to quickly add missing registrations\n\nUsage:\n1. Add [GenerateSqliteDatabase] to your partial database class\n2. Add [RegisterTable(typeof(YourModel))] to classes that use each table\n3. Call the generated Init() method at startup",
